# Server Actions & API routes

- `'use server'` at top of action files under `features/*/actions/`
- Validate input with Zod before mutations (`safeParse`)
- `revalidatePath` / `revalidateTag` after successful writes
- Auth checks inside handler (not middleware-only)
- No secrets in client bundles; safe error messages (i18n keys when applicable)
- App Router shell: [fe-next-app-router.mdc](./fe-next-app-router.mdc)
- Agents: [api/SKILL.md](../agents/api/SKILL.md), [validation/SKILL.md](../agents/validation/SKILL.md)
